              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "bandhu is built on the root √bandh, \"to bind, tie\" (MW): a relative is someone bound to you. The root is inherited from Indo-European, and MW compares English bind. It is a Rigvedic word for \"kinsman\" (CDIAL 9144)."
            }
